<Layout title="Quest downloads - textadventures.co.uk Archive">
    <h1>Quest downloads</h1>

    <p>
        Installers for older versions of Quest, kept here for reference - to compare behaviour
        against a particular version, say, or to run Quest on a version of Windows that the
        current app doesn't support. They are all Windows-only, and none of them is maintained.
    </p>

    <p>
        You almost certainly want Quest Viva instead: it opens the game files Quest 5 saved, and
        plays games in every format Quest has used since 1998. Get it from
        <a href="https://questviva.com">questviva.com</a>, or use it in your browser at
        <a href="https://play.questviva.com">play.questviva.com</a>.
    </p>

